# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# Diagnostic reports (https://nodejs.org/api/report.html)
report.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json

# Runtime data
pids
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
# Everything directly under any .miniphi/ is a per-run audit trail. This is
# `.miniphi/*`, not `.miniphi/`, because git cannot re-include anything inside
# an excluded *directory* — and `memory/` below has to be re-includable.
**/.miniphi/*
# Durable, portable agent memory: the corpus a later run (or another machine)
# recalls from. Text, small, and deliberately tracked. `index.json` stays
# ignored because it is a rebuildable cache keyed by local file mtimes.
!**/.miniphi/memory/
**/.miniphi/memory/index.json
**/.miniphi/memory/*.tmp
config.json
miniphi.config.json
current-benchmarks/

